Review this change for security vulnerabilities.

Changed files (you may Read these and any other file in the repo):
  - macapp/WorkroomApp/Core/AgentResumeCoordinator.swift
  - macapp/WorkroomApp/Core/AgentSessionIndex.swift
  - macapp/WorkroomApp/Core/GhosttyRuntimeAdapter.swift
